-- ╔════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
-- ║            UNIFY FIELD TABLES — FEB 2026                                       ║
-- ║  Consolidate crm_field_definitions/crm_field_values → lead_field_*             ║
-- ║  Keeps lead_ prefix (consistent with leads table pattern)                       ║
